			"id": "nsuMiKeuVyglZ2hsC",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 1 (offense 5, protection -5), threat tier minor, appearing 5."
		},
		{
			"id": "n9JefcJ2vBr-Q_QB-",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/vulture.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "n1bcnXegMyREEwVCS",
			"text": "Independent build total: -100 points of racial traits plus 5 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "naG-uwCSOzwJ9RaXl",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Vulture (SRD 5.1). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "nYvmh2p2dRCV4gAms",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "niN8lKfoIuPT2e3on",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 5 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "nbljRSzpXYcTa1lyq",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 2; air Move 11 (primary). The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "nPbT0Yz5Z1ducgtPQ",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "nwLiiIn2NrwD3S5in",
			"text": "Body about 80 cm, which is the SM -2 row."
		},
		{
			"id": "nC1ZqcjEi_qB9ZR2u",
			"text": "IQ 5 for the same reason as the giant vulture: these are patient, calculating birds rather than merely hungry ones."
		},
		{
			"id": "n79TVK68NXOrXHDgk",
			"text": "Added after a post-hoc comparison against independent GURPS fan conversions of this creature: the Tracking skill, which a creature with Discriminatory Smell should always have. The comparison surfaced the gap; the build is still ours."
		},
		{
			"id": "neoWEog-NxQYfLC0m",
